WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.565
Your keyword engine already has vectors

00:00:33.565 --> 00:01:07.019
First, agree what every position means

00:01:07.019 --> 00:01:37.867
The numbers do not choose AND or OR

00:01:37.867 --> 00:02:10.019
One mention and three mentions look different

00:02:10.019 --> 00:02:45.878
Rarer terms carry more distinguishing weight

00:02:45.878 --> 00:03:19.076
Let extra mentions add less

00:03:19.076 --> 00:03:50.687
A huge coordinate space can be cheap to store

00:03:50.687 --> 00:04:26.033
Ask what the coordinates preserve
